  "content": "## Design Settings » Header Design\n\n\nLink: https://support.brilliantdirectories.com/support/solutions/articles/12000044979\n\n\n## Header Design\n\n\nThis article goes over the Header Design settings.\n\n\n### Visual Guide of Header Settings\n\n\nTo access this section please navigate to :\n\n- Settings\n\n- Design Settings\n\n- General Tab\n\n- Header Design\n\n\n### 1. Display Header\n\n\nHide or Display the Header, options\n\n- Yes\n\n- No\n\n\n### 2. Public Header Menu\n\n\nThe Public Header Menu is going to show for visitors, of the website:\n\n\n### 3. Logged In Header Menu\n\n\nThe Logged In Header Menu is going to display only when members are logged in.\n\n\n### Important Note\n\n\nOnly the default or an exact clone of the Logged In Header Menu is going to work on this area. Other Menus listed on Toolbox >> Menu Manager are not going to work since these are not designed for this area.\n\nUse this Menu option to add links just for members.\n\n\n### 4. Link & Font Size\n\n\nChange the size of the Header Links\n\n\n### 5. Header Menu Item Alignment\n\n\nThis setting determines how the navigation links in the website’s header are positioned horizontally.\n\n\n### 6. Header Search Module\n\n\nThere are several search combinations for this section. For more information about these combinations, review the following support article: Show Header Search\n\n\n### 7. Display Translate Tool\n\n\nThis tool is an Add-on Google Website Translator\n\n\n### 8. Header Background\n\n\nSelect the color of the Header Background.\n\n\n### 9. Link & Font Color\n\n\n\n### 10. Signup Button Background\n\n\n\n### 11. Font Color\n\n\nThe button appears by default on the Header, the link on this button goes to the /join page.\n\n\n### 12. Search Button Background\n\n\n\n### 13. Font Color\n\n\nThe button displays when a Search Module is selected under Header Colors >> Header Search Module .\n\n\n## Header Mobile-View Settings\n\n\nThese settings will apply for all mobile devices, with these settings  hide or display the following sections:\n\n\n### 14. Website Header\n\n\n\n### 15. Website Logo\n\n\nSelect how the logo appears on Mobile-View.\n\n\n### 16. Mini-Nav Links\n\n\nThe options for this section are:\n\n- Display on Mobile\n\n- Hide on Mobile\n\n- Use as Mobile Main Menu\n\n\n### 17. Header Search\n\n\nThe options for this section are:\n\n- Display on Mobile\n\n- Compact on Mobile\n\n- Hide on Mobile",
